    <description>SKILL.md opens with a worked example - a bean under test whose collaborator is auto-mocked - and an agent reproduces it before it reproduces anything else. The code here is that example, kept deliberately close to the text rather than factored, so that a change to the framework which invalidates the sample fails a build instead of silently misleading a reader.</description>
